; SPIRAL GARLAND (no stump), lying along the card, tip to the right - drawn dry, no paint pick-up
; offsets from data/calibration.json: X -14.5  Y +7.1  Z +1.1
; BEFORE STARTING: cartridge OFF (G28 raises the bed to nozzle height). Card in the frame.
M104 S0
M140 S0
M107
G21
G90
G28 ; home with the cartridge off
G1 Z56.10 F600 ; bed down for attaching the brush
M400
M117 Attach brush, then Resume
@pause ; snap the cartridge on, then press Resume
; --- garland
G0 Z16.10 F900
G0 X20.70 Y203.00 F4000
M117 Drawing garland
